kind: skit
id: toaster
title: The Toaster Knows
about: Scribe finds a toaster that answers questions, more or less

[scene 1]
scribe: "I found a toaster in the junk drawer. It answers questions!" ; do gasp
tabby: "Toaster, what is the meaning of life?"
scribe: "It says, toast. Lightly golden." ; do shrug
tabby: "That is a very confident answer." ; do nod

[scene 2]
gruff: "Toaster, how do I fix my broken radio?"
scribe: "It says, have you tried toast?"
gruff: "Honestly? That did help a little." ; do shrug ; react laugh
tabby: "It never knows everything. But it always tries to warm you up."
